    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's hard to talk to people about it because they just tell me to stay positive or that \"it might not be that bad.\" but it is that bad. i have so much dignity left right now. i can still look them in the eye. i don't want to become a burden that everyone has to pity and watch slowly rot away. doesn't it seem more peaceful to just... exit while you still have control over the choice?",
